WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:03.710
Caught in the net covered
arms of the pond.

00:00:03.740 --> 00:00:06.890
The ducks are easy prey
and are picked off by the

00:00:06.890 --> 00:00:10.730
dozen. But as time moves
on, the British

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:13.430
aristocrats turn to ways
to kill even bigger

00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:14.660
numbers of fowl on their
ponds.

00:00:16.770 --> 00:00:20.280
Enter the Punt gun, a
boat mounted anti duck

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:21.270
super weapon.

00:00:21.690 --> 00:00:23.640
Punt guns were massive
guns.

00:00:24.240 --> 00:00:26.190
I mean, if you look at
an old picture of

00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:28.620
somebody holding one of
these things, it looks

00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:30.000
like it shouldn't even
exist.

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:34.080
It had to be mounted to a
special boat called a

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:36.390
punt. And that's how the
gun got its name.

00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:39.330
Up to 14ft long.

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:42.720
A punt gun can turn a
flock of eider ducks into

00:00:42.720 --> 00:00:44.930
entrees before you can
say bang.

00:00:45.590 --> 00:00:48.680
When you fire the punt
gun, you are sending a

00:00:48.680 --> 00:00:52.250
spray of shot into the
air and you could take

00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:56.300
down dozens, maybe even
up to 100 birds in a

00:00:56.300 --> 00:00:57.830
single shot.

